# Project Core (SWP391_G6)

Homestay / Resort Booking Management — multi-property discovery, booking, contracts, payments, ops (HK/inspection/damage), maintenance, reviews, reports.

## Source of truth

- Prefer `docs/Specification_v2.md` for product/business facts.
- Agent standards: `docs/Agents.md`. Briefing summary: `docs/CLAUDE.md`.
- Screens/API/UI: `docs/screen.md`, `docs/api-spec-by-screen.md`, `docs/DESIGN.md`.
- DB dialect: **PostgreSQL** (not SQL Server). UI tokens: Modern Zen teal (`DESIGN.md`), not cream/orange from Figma prompt.

## Stack

- FE: React + TS + Vite + Tailwind + React Query + Zustand/Redux + Axios
- BE: Spring Boot + Security + JPA + JWT + JavaMail + PDF + VNPay + Outbox + WebSocket

## Roles (RBAC + property isolation)

- **Guest** — public browse/auth only
- **Customer** — own bookings/payments/contracts/tickets/reviews
- **Employee** — one Property; assigned HK/maintenance/inspection/damage capture
- **Manager** — assigned Properties only (structure, bookings, pay verify, approve damage)
- **Admin** — global admin; damage co-approve if fee > 5,000,000 VND; no HK ops

## Edit scope

- Allowed: `frontend/`, `backend/`, `docs/`, `tests/`, `scripts/`
- Never touch: `.env*`, `secrets/`, `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`, `target/`, `coverage/`

## Security (always)

- Never hardcode/log secrets or tokens; use parameterized SQL; BCrypt; HTTPS in prod.
- Enforce RBAC + property isolation; verify VNPay signatures and bank receipts before confirm.
- Google account link only if local email already verified. Suspended users cannot login.
